{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mystic Merchant&quot; is a quirky first-person shop management game, catering to adventurers in this\u00a0fantasy world<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/0a92684a49113b11a1b1338994881f40.avif?t=1757586030\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span>Craft the perfect store layout, blending functionality with charm to guide customers seamlessly through your shop. Strategically place each item to catch their eye, and fine-tune every detail to create a space that\u2019s both efficient and enchanting. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/0d273e576a10aac25b290699d6d27977.poster.avif?t=1757586030\" width=552 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/0d273e576a10aac25b290699d6d27977.webm?t=1757586030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/0d273e576a10aac25b290699d6d27977.mp4?t=1757586030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/c9dea89543085e952e347bc1e3ee1d81.avif?t=1757586030\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span>Order supplies and stock your shelves with care, transforming your open workspace into a bustling hub of activity. Organize item containers and arrange shelves thoughtfully, creating a seamless flow that keeps your shop running smoothly and your customers delighted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/7663725052db21b65d4155e5205120e4.poster.avif?t=1757586030\" width=552 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/7663725052db21b65d4155e5205120e4.webm?t=1757586030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/7663725052db21b65d4155e5205120e4.mp4?t=1757586030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/dfca5027d15c2ecf7d239b7f52490a32.avif?t=1757586030\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span>Efficiently handle checkouts, process payments, and provide change with precision and speed to maximize profits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/199403f436f74a84cedc69223f0104b8.poster.avif?t=1757586030\" width=552 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/199403f436f74a84cedc69223f0104b8.webm?t=1757586030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/199403f436f74a84cedc69223f0104b8.mp4?t=1757586030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/fe2cb034887a04b9eff583fc9b768dd2.avif?t=1757586030\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span>Adjust prices based on market trends to maximize profit margins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app